                                "sense_id": "04ae1af9-16e3-397d-9e75-20be325805df",
                                "text": "The kids were laughing at him so he shot back and told her, \"Well, Miss Ortíz, with all due respect, I was taught that boogy is something that comes out of your nose and poopy is something that a dog does on the street.\""
